<p>Dear <%= @first_name %>,</p>

<p>Great news! <%= @child_first_name %> has completed their portion of the waiver for <%= @event_name %>. Now we just need your signature to finalize everything.</p>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <%= mail_button "Sign the Waiver", @waiver_link %>
</p>

<p>Once you've signed, <%= @child_first_name %>'s registration will be complete.</p>

<p>If you have any questions, don't hesitate to email us at <%= mail_to @support_email %>, or just hit reply to this email!</p>
